summary: Snapshot test for cyclictest
description: |
    Functional test for the snapshot feature of the cyclictest utility. Sending
    SIGUSR2 to a running cyclictest instance will capture a snapshot in
    /dev/shm/cyclictest${pid} without interrupting the process, originally requested
    in bz1469185.
contact: Qiao Zhao <qzhao@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
duration: 60m
extra-summary: rt-tests/us/rt-tests/cyclictest/snapshot
extra-task: rt-tests/us/rt-tests/cyclictest/snapshot
